OL,3,AHundreds of Italian schools hit by
OL,4,Athreats in suspected bomb hoax
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome 300 schools across Italy have
OL,7,Freceived bomb threats, according to
OL,8,FEducation Minister Giuseppe Valditara,
OL,9,Fwho described the incidents as probably
OL,10,Fa "cyber-attack, not a genuine risk".
OL,12,FValditara told Italian TV that there
OL,13,Fwas a clear strategy behind the rash of
OL,14,Fthreats in Italy and elsewhere in
OL,15,FEurope which had targeted flights,
OL,16,Fsupermarkets and even hospitals.
OL,18,FThe emails were sent to schools in
OL,19,FRome, Naples, Vicenza, Florence, Pisa,
OL,20,FTrieste and many other Italian cities,
OL,21,Fand a number of buildings were
OL,22,Fevacuated as a precaution.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
